f=A.b(["Set custom monthly and per-transaction spending limits for secondary users.","Secondary user never needs to know the primary user UPI PIN.","Instant revoke capability through Google Pay, PhonePe, or BHIM."],c1)
i=A.eh(h,b5,b4,"UPI Circle is one of the most practical financial innovations for Indian households. Elderly parents or college-going children who may not have independent bank accounts or who hesitate to handle digital payments can now make merchant transactions backed by a primary family member\u2019s account.\n\n### Delegation Models Available\n1. **Full Delegation**: The secondary user can initiate and complete payments up to a monthly cap (e.g. \u20b95,000 or \u20b915,000) with their own phone\u2019s biometric lock.\n2. **Partial Delegation**: The secondary user initiates the purchase at a shop counter, but the primary account holder approves the transaction on their own phone with 1-tap notification.\n      ","NPCI\u2019s new UPI Circle feature lets you delegate payment authorization to family members without sharing your bank account or debit card details. Step-by-step setup.",A.b([],c7),"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563013544-824ae1b704d3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","art-13",!1,!1,!0,f,g,5,"upi-circle-delegated-payments-how-to-set-up-for-parents-and-children",b6,c2,"UPI Circle Delegated Payments: How to Set Up Secondary Wallet Limits for Parents and Kids",A.b([B.GM],c8),i,21300)
